<!doctype html><html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= pageTitle %> · RouteX</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head><body><%- include('partials/topbar',{activePage:appointment?'mine':'schedule'}) %><main class="page-shell"><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Reserva do veículo</span><h1><%= appointment?'Editar agendamento':'Novo agendamento' %></h1><p>Informe início e fim. O sistema não permite duas reservas ativas no mesmo período.</p></div><a class="button button-ghost" href="/schedule">Ver calendário</a></div><%- include('partials/messages') %><section class="card"><form class="form-grid schedule-form" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" action="<%= appointment?`/schedule/${appointment.id}`:'/schedule' %>"><label class="field field-span-2">Título<input name="title" required maxlength="120" value="<%= appointment?.title||'' %>" placeholder="Ex.: Entregas Curitiba / Retirada fornecedor"></label><label class="field">Data<input type="date" name="date" required value="<%= defaultDate %>"></label><label class="field">Início<input type="time" name="startTime" required value="<%= typeof startTime!=='undefined'?startTime:'' %>"></label><label class="field">Final<input type="time" name="endTime" required value="<%= typeof endTime!=='undefined'?endTime:'' %>"></label><label class="field field-span-2">Observações<textarea name="notes" rows="4" placeholder="Informações para quem utilizará o veículo"><%= appointment?.notes||'' %></textarea></label>
<label class="field field-span-2">Associar rota gerada<select name="routeId"><option value="">Nenhuma</option><% myRoutes.forEach(function(r){ %><option value="<%= r.id %>" <%= appointment?.route_id===r.id?'selected':'' %>><%= r.title %> · <%= formatDateTime(r.generated_at) %></option><% }) %></select><small>Ao associar uma rota, o link do Maps e a planilha ficam acessíveis pelo agendamento.</small></label><label class="field field-span-2">Link de rota adicional<input type="url" name="manualRouteUrl" value="<%= appointment?.manual_route_url||'' %>" placeholder="https://maps.app.goo.gl/..."></label><label class="field field-span-2">Anexar planilha XLSX<input type="file" name="spreadsheet" accept=".xlsx,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet"><small>Opcional. Para a planilha gerada pelo próprio RouteX, prefira associar a rota acima.</small></label>
<% if(!appointment){ %><label class="field">Repetição<select name="recurrenceType" id="recurrenceType"><option value="none">Não repetir</option><option value="daily">Repetir diariamente</option></select></label><label class="field" id="recurrenceUntilField">Repetir até<input type="date" name="recurrenceUntil"></label><% } %>
<% if(typeof attachmentList!=='undefined'&&attachmentList?.length){ %><div class="field field-span-2"><span class="mini-label">Anexos atuais</span><div class="inline-actions"><% attachmentList.forEach(function(a){ %><a class="button button-small button-secondary" href="/schedule/attachments/<%= a.id %>"><%= a.original_name %></a><% }) %></div></div><% } %><div class="field-span-2 form-actions"><button class="button button-primary" type="submit"><%= appointment?'Salvar alterações':'Confirmar agendamento' %></button><a class="button button-ghost" href="<%= appointment?'/schedule/mine':'/schedule' %>">Cancelar</a></div></form></section></main><script>const s=document.getElementById('recurrenceType'),f=document.getElementById('recurrenceUntilField');function sync(){if(!f)return;f.style.display=s&&s.value==='daily'?'flex':'none';f.querySelector('input').required=!!(s&&s.value==='daily');}if(s){s.addEventListener('change',sync);sync();}</script></body></html>
